Package: bande-archive-keyring
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Maintainer: Mikael Hug <mikaelhug@gmail.com>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Description: OpenPGP keys of the Bande APT repository
 The keys that sign the Bande APT repository at @ARCHIVE_URL@,
 and an APT pin that allows the repository to provide only Bande's own
 packages.

Package: bande-apt-source
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Mikael Hug <mikaelhug@gmail.com>
Depends: bande-archive-keyring
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Description: Bande APT repository
 Makes APT follow the forky suite of the Bande APT repository for Debian
 14 (forky): the desktop and apps (main). On Apple Silicon it also enables the
 Mac mini kernel (apple), in /etc/apt/sources.list.d/bande-apple.sources;
 copy /usr/share/bande-apt-source/bande-apple.sources there to enable it
 elsewhere, and delete it to turn it off.
